有留心則必受之。無留心則必辭矣。以此卜之。』君因召吳起而與歸，即令公主怒而輕君。吳起見公主之賤君也，則必辭。」於是吳起見公主之賤魏相，果辭魏武侯。武侯疑之而弗信也。吳起懼得罪，遂去，即之楚。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-065-sun:m012-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"田文","kind":"person","person_id":"ev7_bgb_mtr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-065-sun:m012-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"公叔","kind":"person","person_id":"u9a_v5a_08h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-065-sun:m012-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"魏公主","kind":"person","person_id":"5j9_f5f_48v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-065-sun:m012-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"吳起","kind":"person","person_id":"61h_0sk_4pb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-065-sun:m012-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"公叔","kind":"person","person_id":"u9a_v5a_08h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-065-sun:m012-0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"僕","kind":"person","person_id":"f99_rwc_qgo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-065-sun:m012-0027","start":27,"end":28,"surface":"起","kind":"person","person_id":"61h_0sk_4pb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-065-sun:m012-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"公叔","kind":"person","person_id":"u9a_v5a_08h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-065-sun:m012-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"其僕","kind":"person","person_id":"f99_rwc_qgo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-065-sun:m012-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"吳起","kind":"person","person_id":"61h_0sk_4pb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-065-sun:m012-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"武侯","kind":"person","person_id":"p9l_wy7_y7m_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-065-sun:m012-0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"吳起","kind":"person","person_id":"61h_0sk_4pb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-065-sun:m012-0092","start":92,"end":93,"surface